<title>FRANCE: IMETAL H1 TURNOVER RISES.</title>
<headline>IMETAL H1 TURNOVER RISES.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				  5,214   vs   3,957</p>
<p>NOTE - Imetal said in a statement that the figure was up 31.8 percent on a like-for-like basis. Imetal's main activities focus on industrial minerals, building materials and metals processing.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
